# ── Contact form (Formspree) ─────────────────────────────────
# 1. Create a free form at https://formspree.io
# 2. Copy your form ID (looks like "mqkvabcd") and paste it below
# 3. Rename this file to ".env" — Vite loads it automatically
#
# Without it, the contact form falls back to opening the
# visitor's email client (mailto), so nothing breaks.
VITE_FORMSPREE_ID=
